<p class="lt-chem-21770">Considering CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H, (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N, NH<sub>3</sub>, and CH<sub>3</sub>F, which can form hydrogen bonds with themselves? Draw the hydrogen-bonded structures.</p>

