    <dt><strong class="emphasis bold">Answer</strong></dt>
    <dd>
    <p class="lt-chem-21770">CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H and NH<sub>3</sub>;</p>

    

    <figure><img alt="Chemical structures of hydrogenated hydrocarbons, including names labeled: 2-Hexanol and Hydrogen bonding interactions." style="width: 605px; height: 196px;" class="internal" loading="lazy" width="605px" height="196px" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/120026/11.2.2B.png?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=605&amp;height=196" />
